abstract: >
  Multilingual reading repository for Volume I of Qubit of Hope by Ivan Kotov.
  This repository preserves currently available publication assets across seven language editions
  and four reading formats, with transparent documentation of edition drift where present.
  All Rights Reserved. Public reading and personal local download for reading are allowed.
  Redistribution, mirroring, translation, derivative works, audiobook production, narration,
  text-to-speech or synthetic-voice redistribution, media adaptation, AI training or dataset
  redistribution, and commercial reuse require prior written permission from Ivan Kotov.
  Post-deposit DOI synchronization. No literary text or cover artwork changed.
